span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학생 눈높이 맞춤형 창업교육</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">콘텐츠를 제작</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">후배들에게 이를 공유하며 우수 콘텐츠에 대한 평가와 시상을 진행하는</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일반적인 아이디어 경쟁과 차별화된 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교육 콘텐츠 중심의 대회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -98.7pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 98.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">시상규모</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교육부 장관상 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">점</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">예정</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">외 주관기관장상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">등 총</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">점 내외</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">해외캠프 참가 기회제공</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">상금</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-TOP: 2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -90.8pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 90.8pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\